# Information Limit Assessment

**Question:** Can the remaining variance be explained by observable information available to us?

**Tested levels:** L0–L1 | **Max available:** L2

**Conclusion:** missing_information

Exhausted explanatory power at L0–L1. Retest requires L2. Status: untestable until ingested.

## Three outcomes (UOA)

| Outcome | Status |
|---------|--------|
| Missing information (L2+ required) | concluded |
| Irreducible randomness | possible |
| No exploitable relationship | possible |

## Signals

- MI plateau below 0.02 at L0–L1
- Holdout rank correlation near zero — cannot rank opportunities
- 51% UOA failures from indistinguishable candidates at L0–L1

